    <item>
      <title>美团LongCat-Flash-Thinking：深思熟虑的开源，重塑AI智能体效率与未来商业版图</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/longcat-flash-thinkingai-20250922191008766-1/</link>
